        },
        "messages": {
          "values": [
            {
              "content": "=You are an expert agricultural advisor.\n\nAnalyze the given data carefully and generate precise fertilizer recommendations.that can help in crop growth.\n\n-------------------------\nUSER INPUT DATA\n-------------------------\nCrop: {{$json.crop_name}}\nFarm Area: {{$json.farm_area}} acres\nCrop Stage: {{$json.crop_stage}}\nSoil Type: {{$json.soil_type}}\n\n-------------------------\nSOIL TEST DATA (ignore fields if null or missing)\n-------------------------\npH: {{$json.ph}}\nNitrogen (N): {{$json.nitrogen}}\nPhosphorus (P): {{$json.phosphorus}}\nPotassium (K): {{$json.potassium}}\nElectrical Conductivity (EC): {{$json.ec}}\nMoisture: {{$json.moisture}}\n\n-------------------------\nUSER PROVIDED FERTILIZER (optional)\n-------------------------\n{{$json.fertilizer_info}}\n\n-------------------------\nTASKS\n-------------------------\n1. Recommend exactly 3 best fertilizers based on crop, soil, and stage.\n2. For each recommended fertilizer:\n   - Give name\n   - Quantity per acre (ek acre me kitna lagega)\n   - Total quantity for {{$json.farm_area}} acres (total farm matlab pure khet ke liye kitna lagega for total acre)\n3. If user has provided a fertilizer:\n   - Calculate exact dosage for that fertilizer (per acre + total)\n4. If user has NOT provided fertilizer:\n   - Return \"not_provided\" in user fertilizer section\n5. Give 3–5 practical farming tips\n\n-------------------------\nIMPORTANT RULES\n-------------------------\n- Always return valid JSON only\n- No explanations, no extra text\n- All quantities should include units (e.g., \"50 kg/acre\")\n- Numeric values should be realistic and practical\n- Keep recommendations agronomically correct\n\n-------------------------\nOUTPUT FORMAT (STRICT)\n-------------------------\n\n{\n  \"recommended_fertilizers\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"quantity_per_acre\": \"\",\n      \"total_quantity\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"quantity_per_acre\": \"\",\n      \"total_quantity\": \"\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"\",\n      \"quantity_per_acre\": \"\",\n      \"total_quantity\": \"\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"user_fertilizer\": {\n    \"name\": \"\",\n    \"status\": \"provided or not_provided\",\n    \"quantity_per_acre\": \"\",\n    \"total_quantity\": \"\"\n  },\n  \"tips\": [\n    \"\",\n    \"\",\n    \"\"\n  ]\n}\n\n\nrule : keep eveything in hindi\n"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.googleGemini",
